# LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included. A CRLF checkout of
# nr_daemon.py once made a 200-line change read as a 2,000-line rewrite and every later
# change to the file a conflict. cmd.exe is the exception: batch files keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
